						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3548">olthar</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">3/18/2002 - 5:41 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2836">Olthar Othlinden</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2837">Tylendil</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														The raid on Runnnnyyeyes was not too bad, considering the turnout of 6 people, I had to go early but when I left Gnubin was on his way over						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3707">Capias</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">3/18/2002 - 6:18 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2989">Capias Maximus</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Gnubin made it out.  Felious eventually did, too.  Raid was fun, even if the xp wasn't spectacular (you higher levels must have seen nothing but greens).  We would have been virtually deathless, except for poor Scandyl on the way over, if the server hadn't gone down towards the end of the raid, with a couple of us going LD in the Lord room.  <br />
<br />
I would call it a success.  One positive raid under our belt now, and SolA/B sounds like a good choice in a couple of weeks.						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3111">ktadema</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">3/18/2002 - 7:31 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2488">Givins Ntakhiens</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2861">Felious Gudlious</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2487">Izzek Krakumheads</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Yeah, that server crash with all of us in the Lord's room wasn't a real good way to end it, but it looked like we had our area under control.  I would have been there sooner, but I had come on earlier and heard that the raid was canceled.  I was pleased when I came on later and saw you guys in operations.						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3548">olthar</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">3/18/2002 - 1:37 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2836">Olthar Othlinden</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2837">Tylendil</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														yah there was a mixup with gnubin and his comprehension of pst vs est, but we got that all fixed up, too bad that server went down and you were in the lord room. Did everyone get some (or at least shimm) blackened iron/alloy armor?						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=2690">Bickelhaupt</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">3/18/2002 - 3:02 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2143">Bickelhaupt</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2578">Scandyl</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														As I recall a BA chest and a couple of leggings dropped.<br />
<br />
Scandyl managed to get out Monday morning (having learned the difference between Sneak and Hide&amp;Sneak.) Did everyone else get out?						</td>
